      <activity id="823eaa98-0754-5a68-a767-a88c45eefa03" activityNameId="d2c1cebc-fb99-5cf0-a37f-03cecd013c34" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, desktop with LCD monitor, home use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, desktop with LCD monitor, home use
The computer desktop home use is calculated according to the share between active (3.14 hrs/day), standby (2.74 hrs/day) and off (18.24 hrs/day) modes taken from survey information. This dataset describes the application of an LCD monitor.;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: c4023807-e960-345f-a4ac-ed7c32f644a3
Describes the use of a desktop computer with a LCD monitor. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use at home. UCTE production mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Producers, literature, survey and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Daily experiences confirm retrieved data from the survey.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c4023807-e960-345f-a4ac-ed7c32f644a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
